FILE     fbtap.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series a 0 6 10 15 16 0i 30i (nothing series-specific used)
NOTE     drilling cycles are written out as moves; cycle values in D20 D22 D23 D24 D25
NOTE     G43/G49 left out: the DX32 applies the tool length of the tool in the spindle from its table (TENTATIVE)
NOTE     -ftool 1: T1 must be in the spindle when the program starts
NOTE     G84 written as the DX32 G84 between M29 and M28, rigid tapping: only on a DX32 with a closed-loop spindle (-tap rigid, TENTATIVE)
NOTE     the output needs BOSS 4-7 compatibility mode off
WROTE    fbwtapr.txt
CHECK    dxsim reads fbwtapr.txt cleanly and reaches all 14 FANUC end points in order
RESULT   ok
